- label: Fire OS + Vega via react-native-multi-tv-app-sample | description: One Expo codebase for both OSes; keeps the 2018 stick usable but doubles the integration spikes.
- label: Fire OS only via hello-world-fire-tv | description: Native Kotlin with mature Android notifications and intents; no official simulator, so it depends on locating or buying a Fire OS stick.
